\par\par \b \uc2  Russia GKO/Delay/Positive -3: Ease Pressure On Reserves \b0\par\par\uc2 286 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 19 August 1998\par 15:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  "It's important not to make a mistake in this decision," said Fyodorov, who was appointed to the cabinet earlier this week and apparently \b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  personally in the planned restructuring. "It will determine whether \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  can return to world markets within six months, within a year, or within five years." \par \par \uc2  The government has been criticized for failing to explain its new \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  policy following its decision to devalue the ruble Monday, while its clarification Tuesday of a 90-day moratorium on foreign debt payments by Russian banks and companies left many questions unanswered. \par \par \uc2  As much as the decisions themselves, the way in which they have been announced has sapped confidence in the government's handling of economic policy. \par \par \uc2  The fact that it appears now to recognize the need to repair its relations with foreign investors may temper future policy decisions, and the way in which they are announced. \par \par \uc2  "It's encouraging that it (the government) sees that it needs access to the market at some stage," said ANZ's Portman. \par \par \uc2  The restructuring of GKOs will be both good and bad for Russia's existing foreign debt, the price of which has plummeted on international markets in recent weeks. The restructuring will eliminate the drain on the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves from redeeming GKOs, and therefore leave more for the repayment and servicing of the government's foreign debt. \par \par \uc2  "The GKO restructuring will improve the cash flow position substantially, it will have a big impact on relieving the pressure on \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves," said Portman. "The government remains well able to service its external liabilities." \par \par \uc2  (MORE) Dow Jones Newswires 19-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1310GMT \par \par \uc2  1195 4209 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8j0730y\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
