\par\par \b \uc2  Japan Worried About Weaker Yen On Ruble Devaluation - Kyodo \b0\par\par\uc2 210 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 17 August 1998\par 15:55\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1998, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  TOKYO (Dow Jones)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Ministry of Finance\b0 \highlight\uc2  (MOF) officials Monday expressed concerns that Russia's decision effectively to devalue the ruble may lead to the further depreciation of the yen against the U.S. dollar, Kyodo News reported. \par \par \uc2  The German mark may come under downward pressure against the dollar in view of the strong ties between Russia and Germany, and the mark's weakness could spill over into yen-dollar transactions, the ministry officials said, according to Kyodo. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of Russia Monday cut the lower limit for the ruble (RUR) by 34% to RUR9.50 to the dollar, from RUR6.30 to the dollar previously. \par \par \uc2  Moscow resorted to the step because its \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves have fallen too low to continue \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to prop up the ruble. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  has no other choice but to promote its economic rehabilitation in cooperation with the International Monetary Fund, the MOF officials added. \par \par \uc2  Officials at the Ministry of International Trade and Industry, meanwhile, said trade relations between Japan and Russia will not be affected very seriously by the ruble devaluation. \par \par \uc2  Bilateral trade is conducted mainly in dollars and other non-ruble \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2 , they said. \par \par \uc2  (END) Dow Jones Newswires 17-08-98 \par \par \uc2  1355GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020010916du8h06x70\par }\page {\par\fs20{