\par\par \b \uc2  Russian shares end stronger after yen gains. \b0\par\par\uc2 263 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 4 August 1998\par 17:43\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1998 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Aug 4 (Reuters) - Russian shares surged higher in thin trade on Tuesday as local traders turned bullish following an afternoon strengthening in the yen, dealers said. \par \par \uc2  Reuters composite index rose 2.33 percent to 99.86 from 97.59 on Monday, when the index lost 4.79 percent against a background of troubled Asian markets. \par \par \uc2  "Russian players are traditionally more oriented toward buying," said Regent European Securities trader Nikolai Gusev. "Since there is no news about Russia that one could play on, everyone has started to look to Asia." \par \par \uc2  The yen, which had earlier slipped to 146 to the dollar, rebounded to 144.89 in early New York trading on Tuesday after Japan's new government warned \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets to beware of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the yen. \par \par \uc2  In \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , national power grid UES advanced to $0.1290 from $0.1230 on Monday, LUKoil bounced up to $8.15 from $8.00 and Rostelekom was at $2.235 from $2.280. \par \par \uc2  But dealers said thin volumes had boosted levels, too, and said the absence of Western clients would leave the rise shortlived. \par \par \uc2  "Activity is very low and when there are low volumes the market makes fairly sharp twists," said one trader at a Western investment company. "These levels don't attract either big buyers or big sellers." \par \par \uc2  And Regent's Gusev added: "At these levels it's dangerous to short and it's also frightening to buy." ((Olga Popova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941-8520 moscow.newsroom@reuters.com)). \par \par \uc2  (C) Reuters Limited 1998. \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020021108du84012e0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
