\par\par \b \uc2  Russia Markets -2: Strong Fundamentals, But Mkts Wobble \b0\par\par\uc2 262 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 2 Dezember 1997\par 19:42\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1997, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  Even now, analysts note that Russia's economic situation is better than that of many of its emerging-markets rivals. \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves remain high, Russia's running a healthy trade surplus and the economy is showing signs of recovery. \par \par \uc2  'Russia is fundamentally better off, but now it's not the fundamentals which play the major role,' said said Pavel Teplukhin, chief economist at Troika Dialog, a Moscow brokerage. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday, traders said, selling pressure on bonds and the ruble eased a bit, but markets remained jittery. \par \par \uc2  On the hard-\b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  debt market, foreign investors voted strong support for Russia, bidding prices sharply higher. \par \par \uc2  Adding to the enthusiasm was the signing in London Tuesday of the long-awaited rescheduling of Russia's $32.3 billion in debts to the London Club of commercial banks, mostly German, formally pulling Russia out of default. \par \par \uc2  Analysts expect the buying to spread to the local market in the next few weeks, as investors are drawn back into Russia by yields peaking over 50%. \par \par \uc2  'People are going to wait another day or two to see if the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is really going to stop \b \highlight22\uc2 intervening\b0 \highlight\uc2  and where rates are going,' said Brigitte Granville, \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  economist at J.P. Morgan in London. \par \par \uc2  'But there are very few people who are not going to buy at these rates,' she added. \par \par \uc2  For the moment, however, instability in the \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market has made hedging almost impossible, leaving many foreign investors effectively locked out of the market. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 02-12-97 \par \par \uc2  1842GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011006dtc20991o\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
