\par\par \b \uc2  Russian C.Bank t-bill purchases bear fruit. \b0\par\par\uc2 418 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 November 1997\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1997 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Nov 27 (Reuters) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  heavily on the government securities market on Thursday, pressing long-term paper down near its refinancing rate of 28 percent and dealers said its efforts had finally borne fruit. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     rouble/dollar\tab      Nov 27\tab \tab    Nov 26\par \tab \tab \tab \tab midday\tab    morning   close\par     today delivery\tab 5,918-21\tab  5,918-21  5,919.0-21.5\par \f28 \par \par \uc2      tomorrow delivery   5,924.8-25.0   5,925-26  5,924.5-25.3 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par     overnight credits (%)   15-20\tab    20-25\tab 28-34\par     \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 \tab \tab    5,910/5,924\tab   5,909/5,923\par     official rate\tab \tab   5,917.0\tab \tab 5,916.0\par     MICEX\tab \tab \tab     5,924.0\tab \tab 5,923.0\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "There are no big sales (of government paper) any more," a dealer said. "The period of uncertainty is lasting for quite a long time, everyone expects prices to be lower, but the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is holding the market."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  raised 1.75 trillion roubles from selling GKO discount Treasury bills, satisfying demand left from Wednesday's auctions and soaking up excess roubles.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par On Wednesday the Finance Ministry had to use 1.7 trillion roubles of federal Treasury funds to repay maturing paper as prices offered by banks at T-bill auctions were too low.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "In the short-term perspective yesterday's Finance Ministry measures were justified -- the money was not taken without repayment, but just for one day and it acted in line with the budget article on servicing state debt," ING Bank dealer Anatoly Shvedov said.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par A dealer said he saw a price rise in one of the papers auctioned on Wednesday for the first time in many weeks.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The banks which bought two-month T-bills gained 10 basis minimal," he said. "Besides, the balance between supply and demand in the six-month GKO sector has been restored. It looks like we have reached the bottom on short-term paper."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market was quiet due to the Thanksgiving holiday in the United States.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  has been offering one day and seven day deposits and tomorrow next deals for the second day in a row to cut rouble liquidity.\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par "The \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  is trying various measures to influence the market, mostly aimed at affecting morale," a dealer said. "Besides, it will help banks to place extra roubles if they are running short of credit lines to one other."\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par ((Anna Smirnova, Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520 moscow.newsroom@reuters.com))\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par (c) Reuters Limited 1997\par \f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011003dtbr01v98\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
