\par\par \b \uc2  Dubinin says Russia has reserves to defend rouble. \b0\par\par\uc2 322 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 11 September 1996\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Sept 11 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chairman Sergei Dubinin said on Wednesday that Russia has sufficient reserves to keep the rouble within its exchange rate corridor against the dollar. \par \par \uc2  Dubinin told a news conference \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  had, in spite of significant \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  to support the rouble in August, managed to keep its foreign reserves within levels agreed with the International Monetary Fund. \par \par \uc2  "Despite the quite large volume of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , by buying gold and other similar \b \highlight22\uc2 operations\b0 \highlight\uc2 , we are managing to support the necessary level of net international reserves and not to allowing a fall either in gross or net reserves," he said. \par \par \uc2  Dubinin earlier said the bank had spent $1.6 billion on \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  in August, when a faster than usual decline in the rouble made short-term T-bills unattractive. \par \par \uc2  Under Russia's crawling peg exchange rate policy, which runs until the end of this year, the rouble should be trading in a 5,500-6,100 per dollar corridor on December 31 this year. \par \par \uc2  The rouble was fixed at 5,373 per dollar on Wednesday on the Moscow Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange (MICEX). \par \par \uc2  "We have sufficient reserves to keep the rouble exchange rate within the framework of the corridor as we consider necessary," said Dubinin, adding they were approximately the same as at the beginning of July. \par \par \uc2  He said in late July that gross \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  reserves in mid-July were $14.9 billion. \par \par \uc2  Net reserves are one of the economic indicators for which the IMF has set targets under its $10 billion, three-year loan agreement with Russia. \par \par \uc2  First deputy chairman Alexander Khandruyev said the current situation was calm, but that there was some pressure on the rouble. \par \par \uc2  He said the bank's board had on Wednesday discussed various options for exchange rate policy after the expiry of the corridor. It was not yet clear which would be adopted. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds9b036xq\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
