\par\par \b \uc2  Russia central banker says rouble in managed float. \b0\par\par\uc2 264 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 31 Januar 1996\par 13:30\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1996 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, Jan 31 (Reuter) - The rouble is already effectively floating but it is too soon to say what \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime will be introduced when the current fluctuation limits expire at the end of June, a top central banker said on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  "It is clear that we have entered a period of dirty float," first deputy chairman Alexander Khandruyev told Reuters. \par \par \uc2  A dirty float, also known as a managed float, is a system in which no official parities for \b \highlight22\uc2 currencies\b0 \highlight\uc2  are declared but the monetary authorities \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2  in \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  markets. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2  stabilised the rouble last summer, introducing a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  "corridor" with upper and lower limits in July. The current 4,550-5,150 per dollar corridor runs until July 1. \par \par \uc2  Khandruyev said the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would start discussions on a new \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  regime after the bank and government have agreed an economic policy declaration in February. \par \par \uc2  It was possible that the corridor could be continued. \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  chairman Sergei Dubinin has said the authorities could find some other way of regulating the rouble in the second half of the year. \par \par \uc2  The rouble has stayed well within the corridor, although in recent weeks the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has allowed it to fall. \par \par \uc2  The rouble fell to 4,734 per dollar on Wednesday on the Moscow Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange (MICEX) from 4,640 at the start of the year and around 4,500 in early November. \par \par \uc2  But Khandruyev said the corridor may be preserved, adding that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  had not yet discussed the matter. \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1996 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011018ds1v01bjr\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
