\par\par \b \uc2  Russian Ruble Down Vs Dlr; Heavy  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 217 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 29 November 1995\par 15:36\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW (AP-DJ)--\b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's ruble sank against the dollar Wednesday, but was held above the psychologically-important 4600-ruble mark by heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  One trader said the bank sold about $100 million in the interbank market - a huge sum in Russia's tiny \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  market. \par \par \uc2  Speculators were badly hurt by the sales, which came when the dollar touched the level of 4496-99 rubles, said Alexei Kirilov, analyst with Alfa Bank in Moscow. \par \par \uc2  The Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  has been on a steady downward trek against the dollar in recent weeks, a movement that the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  has not tried to stop. After the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  weakened at its official fixing early in the day, many speculators had bet the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would permit further slippage beyond 4600 rubles to the dollar. \par \par \uc2  'It was a day of great speculation, great profits and great loss.' said Kirilov. 'It was a very large reversal.' \par \par \uc2  On the Moscow Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange (MICE), Russia's largest, the dollar rose to change hands at 4581 rubles, up from 4778 rubles Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  Volume on the exchange was an extremely light $14.29 million, down from $36 million on Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 29-11-95 \par \par \uc2  1436GMT \par \par \uc2  1150 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drbt09fhk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
