\par\par \b \uc2  Russian Ruble Steady Vs. Dlr; Weakness Still Expected \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 15 November 1995\par 17:09\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW (AP-DJ)--The ruble held steady against the dollar Wednesday, with traders reluctant to sell the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  after Tuesday's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  of the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  On the Moscow Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange (MICE), Russia's largest, the dollar was fixed at 4532 rubles, the same as the day before. \par \par \uc2  Volume was $24 million, down from $48 million Tuesday. Demand for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was more subdued than the day before, and the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was forced to buy $7.73 million to close dealings. \par \par \uc2  On the interbank market, the dollar traded in a very narrow range throughout dealings. Late in the afternoon, the dollar for Thursday delivery changed hands at 4539-42 rubles, down a touch from 4540-43 the day before. \par \par \uc2  Anna Sidelnikova, head of trading for Most Bank, said there was plenty of demand for dollars in the interbank market, but that quotes were held back by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , which checked rates several times. \par \par \uc2  She said, however, that the dollar is likely to resume its march upward against the ruble in the coming days. Customer orders still seem to be predominantly for dollars, and traders believe the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  would like to see a gradual decline in the ruble, to accomodate for inflation in the Russian economy, she said. \par \par \uc2  Thursday, she said, the dollar is likely to rise to around the level of 4545-50 rubles, 'but not much higher,' she said. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 15-11-95 \par \par \uc2  1609GMT \par \par \uc2  1150 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drbf08zkd\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
