\par\par \b \uc2  Russian Ruble Lower Vs. Dlr; Customer Orders For Dlrs \b0\par\par\uc2 255 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 November 1995\par 16:11\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW (AP-DJ)--The ruble sank against the dollar in thin trading Monday, its fall slowed in the interbank market by the threat of \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  On the Moscow Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange (MICE), \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's largest, the dollar was fixed at 4525 rubles, up from 4522 the day before. \par \par \uc2  Volume was $44 million, up from $32 million Friday. Demand for the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was heavy on the exchange, and the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold about $15 million to slow the dollar's rise, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The ruble fell further on the interbank market, where traders said volume was extremely low. Late in the afternoon, the dollar for Tuesday delivery changed hands at 4535-38 rubles, up from 4523-26 rubles on Friday. \par \par \uc2  Traders saw few new reasons to explain the ruble's decline Monday. The ruble is widely expected to slide decline gradually against the dollar, and banks as well as their customers are buying more U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  as a hedge, they said. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the Russian \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  is not interested in halting the ruble's fall. In the interbank market Monday, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  checked rates several times but did not \b \highlight22\uc2 intervene\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  'Everyone seems to know the ruble is going down - there is no shift in sentiment,' said a treasurer with one large commercial bank in Moscow. 'I think we'll see more of the same in the next few days.' \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-11-95 \par \par \uc2  1511GMT \par \par \uc2  1150 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025drbd08xc8\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
