\par\par \b \uc2  Russian Ruble Up Again Vs. Dlr;  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Slows Rise \b0\par\par\uc2 216 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 27 Juli 1995\par 15:19\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW (AP-DJ)--The Russian ruble forged higher against the dollar Thursday, but was beaten back from intraday highs in the interbank market by \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  On the Moscow Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange (MICE), Russia's largest, the dollar was fixed at 4415 rubles Thursday, down from 4465 Wednesday and the lowest since Feb. 23. \par \par \uc2  Traders said the ruble's accelerating uptrend spurred investors to unload the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2 , at the same time providing speculative opportunities for ruble buyers. \par \par \uc2  Volume on the exchange was a moderate $123.45 million Thursday, up sharply from $55.86 million the day before. Initial dollar-sell orders exceeded buy orders by nearly $216 million. \par \par \uc2  After the fixing, the dollar fell even further in the interbank trading, touching a low of 4385 rubles before some aggressive buying by the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  brought it back up to the level of about 4400 rubles. \par \par \uc2  'The (dollar) rate went up in a very short period of time,' said Konstantin Zuranov, trader with Tokobank in Moscow. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's move steadied the market, dealers said, and the U.S. \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  was quoted late around 4410-13 rubles for Friday delivery. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 27-07-95 \par \par \uc2  1319GMT \par \par \uc2  1150 \par \