\par\par \b  \highlight22\uc2 Russia \highlight\uc2  M2 Money Supply -2: Linked To  \highlight22\uc2 Forex Intervention \highlight\b0\par\par\uc2 226 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 20 Juni 1995\par 13:10\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 Central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials have said heavy dollar buying began in late March as investors moved back into rubles in search of higher yields. In April, according to \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  traders, the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  was the main dollar buying, building up its reserves but flooding the economy with new rubles. \par \par \uc2  In May, the bank announced that its reserves were large enough and that dollar buying would slow. The dollar has fallen 10% against the ruble since the beginning of May. \par \par \uc2  Officials in the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  and the government have warned that continued \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  would threaten money-supply targets and risk fueling inflation. \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rudimentary financial markets make it difficult for the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to sterilize \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by taking excess rubles out of circulation. \par \par \uc2  Tuesday, \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  officials said new mechanisms are being set up to reduce the effect of \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , adding that money-supply targets will be met. \par \par \uc2  According to \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  figures, M2 totalled 132.0 trillion rubles on June 1, 124.5 trillion on May 1, 107.3 trillion on April 1 and 97.8 trillion on Jan. 1. \par \par \uc2  Last year, M2 growth averaged 9.5% a month, fueled mainly by \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  credits to cover the budget deficit, widely regarded as the main source of inflation. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 20-06-95 \par \par \uc2  1110GMT \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr6k04kqk\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
