\par\par \b \uc2  Russian Ruble/Amplifier -3: Gains Seen Through Summer \b0\par\par\uc2 265 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 13 Juni 1995\par 18:29\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  'There haven't been any such injections this year and the government has no intention to make them,' says Sergei Alexashenko, former deputy finance minister and now chief economist at the Russian Union of Industrialists and Entrepreneurs. \par \par \uc2  'I think all those fears of a new Black Tuesday are unfounded,' he added. Last year's fiscal debauchery sent inflation surging and led to the Oct. 11 \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  crisis known as Black Tuesday, when the ruble plunged 21% in a single session. \par \par \uc2  But tension is expected to build. \par \par \uc2  For the next few weeks at least, analysts say, the ruble is headed for further gains. Summer is a slack period on Russian markets and demand for the dollar in particular usually sags. In June 1993, for example, the ruble managed a winning streak that lasted nearly two months. \par \par \uc2  'I don't see any reason for the dollar to rise earlier than late September or early August,' says Alexei Kirillov, a \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  analyst at Most Bank. \par \par \uc2  Kirillov said the next line of support for the dollar is around 4700 rubles, but some economists suggest that the dollar could fall as far as 4000 rubles before becoming truly undervalued. \par \par \uc2  The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 , meanwhile, is showing little taste for heavy \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . Tuesday, the dollar fell 40 points before the bank stepped in, traders said. \par \par \uc2  Even with reduced \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 , \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's rudimentary money and securities markets can't handle the massive inflow of rubles the shift out of the dollar has caused, analysts say. \par \par \uc2  (MORE) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 13-06-95 \par \par \uc2  1629GMT \par \par \uc2  1142 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr6d04enm\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
