\par\par \b \uc2  Russian  \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervenes \highlight\uc2  to support rouble. \b0\par\par\uc2 259 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 8 Juni 1995\par \uc2 Reuters News\par \uc2 LBA\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 (c) 1995 Reuters Limited\par \par \uc2  MOSCOW, June 8 (Reuter) - \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  sold dollars aggressively on the interbank market to break expectations the rouble will continue to weaken, traders said. \par \par \uc2  The rouble fell to 4,911 from 4,906 to the dollar on the Moscow Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange (MICEX) but later rose in interbank trading to 4,888/91 for tomorrow settlement from 4,910/13 on Wednesday. \par \par \uc2  Overnight rouble funds rose to 35-40 from 25 percent. \par \par \uc2  An Imperial Bank dealer said the rouble was likely to continue rising. "Banks are dumping their dollars," he said. \par \par \uc2  Vladimir Ostrovski of Neftekhimbank said the rouble's 22 point rise was largely due to the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \par \par \uc2  "The \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  wants to break the illusion of a forthcoming rouble fall," he said. \par \par \uc2  The fall in the rouble over the last two days had pushed rouble/dollar futures up sharply, forcing the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  to act against the expectations of a lower rouble. \par \par \uc2  Economy Minister Yevgeny Yasin said companies and private individuals were now selling hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  actively. But \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  purchases of hard \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  had released roubles on to the market, fuelling inflation, he said in an article in Izvestia. \par \par \uc2  But Duma budget committee chairman Mikhail Zadornov attributed recent rouble strength to seasonal factors, and said it was premature to talk of economic stabilisation. \par \par \uc2  "The general situation of Russia's economy is very alarming and the current rouble stabilisation has no economic backup," he told the newspaper. \par \par \uc2  --Moscow Newsroom, +7095 941 8520 \par \par \uc2  (c) Reuters Limited 1995 \par \par \uc2 Dokument lba0000020011103dr68073a1\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw184\pich22\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2760\pichgoal330
