\par\par \b \uc2  Russian Ruble Steadies Vs. Dlr;  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Buys Dlrs \b0\par\par\uc2 257 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 25 Januar 1995\par 17:33\par \uc2  Dow Jones International News \par \uc2 DJI\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2  (Copyright (c) 1995, Dow Jones & Co., Inc.) \par \par \uc2  MOSCOW (AP-DJ)--The ruble held steady against the dollar Wednesday, but only thanks to huge \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2  by the \b \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  of \b \highlight22\uc2 Russia\b0 \highlight\uc2 , soaking up huge dollar sales by commercial banks, traders said. \par \par \uc2  At the Moscow Interbank \b \highlight22\uc2 Currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  Exchange (MICE), Russia's largest, the dollar was fixed at 3988.0 rubles Wednesday, unchanged from Tuesday. \par \par \uc2  'Everyone's out of rubles,' said Alexander Afonin, chief dealer at Credo Bank. \par \par \uc2  Off the MICE, where the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2 's influence isn't as strong, the dollar fell below 3900 rubles Wednesday, trading as much as 100 points below the MICE level. \par \par \uc2  Afonin noted that Russian companies need rubles this week for tax payments, leaving the market undersupplied. Rising ruble interest rates - overnight quotes have surged above 400% a year - also are drawing funds out of the dollar, traders said. \par \par \uc2  New \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  regulations imposed last week to sap demand for the dollar also have thinned demand this week, leaving the \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\uc2  the main buyer at the MICE. \par \par \uc2  Wednesday, traders said, the bank bought about 140 million dlrs of the 214 million dlrs traded. \par \par \uc2  'They won't let the dollar fall,' said Afonin. Instead, traders said, the bank has taken the opportunity to build up its reserves. \par \par \uc2  The market is expected to stabilize slightly by the end of this week, traders said, with rubles flowing in. \par \par \uc2  Thursday, however, the dollar is likely to remain steady or gain only slightly, traders said. \par \par \uc2  (END) AP-DOW JONES NEWS 25-01-95 \par \par \uc2  1633GMT \par \par \uc2  1150 \par \par \uc2 Dokument dji0000020011025dr1p00fq9\par }\par \b \uc2 Zusammenfassung der Suche\b0\par \par  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Text\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 (foreign exchange or fx or forex or currenc*) and (interven* or operation*) and (Russia near10 interven*) and (rst=trtw or rst=tprw or rst=tdjw) and (central bank or ministry of finance or treasury ministry or monetary authority)\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \uc2 Datum\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\intbl\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 \li50\uc2 01/01/1995 bis 21/08/2023\cell \pard \ql \li0\ri0\widctlpar\aspalpha\aspnum\faauto\adjustright\rin0\lin0 {  \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx2000\clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrdrr\brdrs \cellx9072\row } \trowd\trgaph15\trqc\trleft-15 \clvertalt\clbrdrt\brdrs\clbrdrl\brdrs\clbrdrb\brdrs\clbrd